            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Thimble 0.9.2 makes it easier to let a project's Docs page read its repo.

- Choose Folder opens on the folder that holds your repos, usually Developer, so Allow is all it takes.
- Picking a folder inside a repo, such as its docs folder, no longer leaves the Docs page asking forever. Thimble asks again and names the folder to choose.
]]></description>
